msgstr "选择要恢复的镜像文件，再次按回车"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:58
#: b405562771584503ba6ccf2dd011a435
msgid ""
"Choose the target disk to be overwritten. Any data on that disk will be "
