msgstr "选择「Yes check the image before restoring」并按回车。这将确保复制到 USB 上的镜像文件完好无损。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:60
#: 5a3faf96608c4259a5307aa9eb138980
msgid "Select \"-p choose\" . Press enter to any prompt till restoration begins"
msgstr "选择「-p choose」。按回车直到恢复开始"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:61
