#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:81
#: 74010e90352549a1939c3a97736c747e
msgid "Configure ArduPilot"
msgstr "配置 ArduPilot"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:83
#: fa7696bed1604cb3b6646869fbc28183
msgid ""
"Connect to the autopilot with a ground station (i.e. Mission Planner) and "
"check that the following parameters are set:"
msgstr "使用地面站（如 Mission Planner）连接飞控，确认以下参数已正确设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:85
#: b6bd57e767fb4ab791fd5708a697f971
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 2 (MAVLink2).  Note this "
"assumes the companion computer is connected to AutoPilot \"Telem2\" port."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = "
"2（MAVLink2）。注意：此处假设伴飞计算机连接到飞控「Telem2」端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:86
#: 8786fa32230b4f8cb79d2389306b9465
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 921 (921600 baud)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 921（921600 波特率）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:88
#: 477949ca6c63402bae18f360f3887b4d
msgid ""
"Enable any of the :ref:`obstacle avoidance <common-object-avoidance-landing-"
"page>` of your own choosing. :ref:`Simple avoidance behavior <common-simple-"
"object-avoidance>` (Stop/Slide) will be used as the example for this wiki:"
msgstr ""
"根据需要启用任意 :ref:`避障 <common-object-avoidance-landing-page>` 模式。以下以 "
":ref:`简单避障行为 <common-simple-object-avoidance>` （停止/滑行）为例："

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:90
#: a8c7f797d9da46d98ab63905ed7f58cc
msgid "Example setup below shown for first proximity sensor:"
msgstr "以下为第一个近距传感器的设置示例："

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:92
#: c90fe2f6699149c49f51d42f81ad3c68
msgid ":ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` = 2: for MAVLink"
msgstr ":ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` = 2：用于 MAVLink"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:93
#: 556c1674c7894c80b00eb3c88356ba1c
msgid ""
":ref:`AVOID_ENABLE <AVOID_ENABLE>` = 7: “All” to use all sources of barrier "
"information including “Proximity” sensors"
msgstr ":ref:`AVOID_ENABLE <AVOID_ENABLE>` = 7：「全部」，使用所有障碍物信息来源，包括「近距离」传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:95
#: 72720e6706a64128ab5523190799178d
msgid "Example of specifics for ``Loiter`` and ``AltHold`` mode:"
msgstr "``Loiter`` 和 ``AltHold`` 模式的具体示例："

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:97
#: 49c68db1cdd849d089667f5f98627815
msgid ""
":ref:`AVOID_MARGIN <AVOID_MARGIN>` = 1.5: How many meters from the barrier "
"the vehicle will attempt to stop or try to slide along it"
msgstr ":ref:`AVOID_MARGIN <AVOID_MARGIN>` = 1.5：飞行器将在距障碍物多少米处尝试停止或沿其侧滑"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:98
#: 2e86880e7fc042da9e06d74a8d81b871
msgid ""
":ref:`AVOID_BEHAVE <AVOID_BEHAVE>` = 1: Whether the vehicle should simply "
"Stop (1) in front of the barrier or Slide (0) around it"
msgstr ":ref:`AVOID_BEHAVE <AVOID_BEHAVE>` = 1：飞行器在障碍物前应简单地停止（1）还是绕行（0）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:99
#: baa4301c09cd4556ab56d70b99283b09
msgid ""
":ref:`AVOID_DIST_MAX <AVOID_DIST_MAX>` = 1.5: How far from a barrier the "
"vehicle starts leaning away from the barrier in AltHold"
msgstr ""
":ref:`AVOID_DIST_MAX <AVOID_DIST_MAX>` = 1.5：飞行器在 AltHold 中开始向障碍物反方向倾斜的距离"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:100
#: bb8522c271aa44188bf4a50ebf52a8b4
msgid ""
":ref:`AVOID_ANGLE_MAX <AVOID_ANGLE_MAX>` = 3000: How far the vehicle will "
"try to lean away from the barrier in centidegrees."
msgstr ""
":ref:`AVOID_ANGLE_MAX <AVOID_ANGLE_MAX>` = 3000：飞行器尝试向障碍物反方向倾斜的最大角度（百分之一度）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:102
#: 3b87040e0c564d73af9f04efba6a4251
msgid ""
"**Optional**: You can assign an RC switch to enable Avoidance instead of "
"always on by default. Example of setting RC7 to switch Avoidance on in "
"Mission Planner:"
msgstr ""
"**可选**：您可以指定 RC 开关来启用避障功能，而不是默认始终开启。以下为在 Mission Planner 中将 RC7 配置为避障开关的示例："

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:108
#: fcfdb6fd01054c459a4029c9c45a1e6a
msgid "After the parameters are modified, reboot the autopilot."
msgstr "参数修改完成后，重启飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:112
#: a52fc2d425ab4efca7efdb13c63fee88
msgid "Ground Test: Pre-Flight Verification"
msgstr "地面测试：飞前验证"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:114
#: 69d4c59cbf034685884a6501d3ddd323
msgid ""
"To verify that the APSync image is working and everything has been correctly"
" configured ensure ArduPilot is receiving ``OBSTACLE_DISTANCE`` messages, on"
" Mission Planner: press ``Ctrl+F`` and click on “Mavlink Inspector”, you "
"should be able to see data coming in:"
msgstr ""
"为验证 APSync 镜像正常工作且所有配置正确，请确认 ArduPilot 正在接收 ``OBSTACLE_DISTANCE`` 消息。在 "
"Mission Planner 中：按 ``Ctrl+F`` 并点击「Mavlink Inspector」，应可看到数据传入："

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:120
#: edcda97944354528a99a6a3cafb46d06
msgid ""
"If you have a stable telemetry connection, the data frequency for "
"``OBSTACLE_DISTANCE`` message should be close to ``15 hz``. If not, use a "
"USB cable to connect AP and GCS to make sure that the obstacle avoidance "
"data is being received as intended by AP before moving on."
msgstr ""
"在数传连接稳定的情况下，``OBSTACLE_DISTANCE`` 消息的数据频率应接近 ``15 hz``。若不满足，请使用 USB "
"线连接飞控和地面站，确保避障数据按预期被飞控接收后再继续。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:122
#: a7b6cdfe362844eb81e3b53f7e5fdbc6
msgid ""
"Within Mission Planner, open the ``Proximity view`` (``Ctrl-F`` > "
"``Proximity``):"
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner 中，打开 ``Proximity view`` （``Ctrl-F`` > ``Proximity``）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:124
#: 51414d4bac3243eebc5b05086b7d87cd
msgid ""
"Put the vehicle/depth camera in front of some obstacles, check that the "
"distance to the nearest obstacle is accurate is shown in the Proximity view."
msgstr "将飞行器/深度相机置于障碍物前，检查近距离视图中显示的最近障碍物距离是否准确。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:130
#: 29a1ecaecc9443438574d031e456f514
msgid ""
"The proximity view will group every distances within 45-degrees arc together"
" (in total 8 quadrants around the vehicle), so at most only 3 **nearest** "
"obstacles will be shown at any one time on the Proximity window (since the "
"camera's FOV is less then 90 degrees)."
msgstr ""
"近距离视图会将45度弧范围内的所有距离归为一组（飞行器周围共8个象限），因此在近距离窗口中最多同时显示3个 **最近** "
"障碍物（因为相机视场角小于90度）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:133
