msgstr "首次飞行建议："

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:137
#: 778a54a4c71e4a238fd38aaaa2435a79
msgid ""
"Test process: Take-off -> AltHold / Loiter -> Move toward the obstacle."
msgstr "测试流程：起飞 -> AltHold / Loiter -> 向障碍物飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:139
#: 1a5a4163f7f34e4698c8487f8dd18f19
msgid "Only push the vehicle gently and observe the reactions."
msgstr "仅轻推飞行器并观察反应。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:141
#: 37ee0918e0664e92becdbf9cba56976e
msgid ""
"Expected behavior: The vehicle should stop/slide (set by ``AVOID_BEHAVE``) "
"at a certain distance away from the obstacle (set by "
"``AVOID_MARGIN/AVOID_DIST_MAX`` depending on the flight mode)."
msgstr ""
"预期行为：飞行器应在距障碍物一定距离处停止/侧滑（由 ``AVOID_BEHAVE`` 设置），该距离由 "
"``AVOID_MARGIN/AVOID_DIST_MAX`` 决定（取决于飞行模式）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:144
#: 6c121c09ab734aa4a7f082ecfd6d41ca
msgid ""
"If everything works as expected, the next step is to test out the safety "
"margins for your specific sensor/vehicle/environment:"
msgstr "若一切按预期工作，下一步是针对您的具体传感器/飞行器/环境测试安全裕度："

#: ../../source/docs/common-realsense-depth-camera.rst:146
#: 63e7f3e9c3d048f8b7ebceccfe9e54c9
msgid ""
"Since the camera has limited FOV and min/max depth range, it is important to"
